{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For generations, this land has whispered a strange legend:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;On nights when the mist falls, never walk outside. If shadows begin to sway, shut your doors immediately.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the mist blankets the town, yokai emerge from nowhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They follow the scent of human presence\u2014<br>and once they find you, they show no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ayase Izumi, Mio Gionji, Kyosuke Mochizuki, and Aki Naruse were all looking forward to their summer vacation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But on the night before their break began, the town was swallowed by mist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>RINNE TENJOU</i></strong> is a game that weaves together the intertwined memories of four boys and girls, their confrontation with the past, and the bonds they forge with one another\u2014all set in a town consumed by mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features two main modes:<br><strong>Adventure Mode</strong> and <strong>Action Mode</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Adventure Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the prologue\u2014what happened before the mist consumed the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671560/extras/ADOVENTURE.gif?t=1747965031\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Action Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a mysterious underground world and unravel the hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671560/extras/ACTION.gif?t=1747965031\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Version Includes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adventure Mode</strong>: Experience the chapter of \u201cIzumi Ayase\u201d and \u201cGionji Mio\u201d.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Action Mode</strong>: Experience the chapter of \u201cIzumi Ayase.\u201d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3671560?t=1747965031","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3671560?t=1747965031","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671560/fdb5c2b537424b0775add55f450b53b0cb297b77/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747965031","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671560/fdb5c2b537424b0775add55f450b53b0cb297b77/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747965031","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For generations, this land has whispered a strange legend:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;On nights when the mist falls, never walk outside. If shadows begin to sway, shut your doors immediately.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the mist blankets the town, yokai emerge from nowhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They follow the scent of human presence\u2014<br>and once they find you, they show no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ayase Izumi, Mio Gionji, Kyosuke Mochizuki, and Aki Naruse were all looking forward to their summer vacation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But on the night before their break began, the town was swallowed by mist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>RINNE TENJOU</i></strong> is a game that weaves together the intertwined memories of four boys 